+# Transport compression policy
+
+No decision on the transport compression codec is currently recorded for this project, so no codec is specified here. The only compression found in the repository is the gzip that protobuf generates automatically in `testdata/protoexample/test.pb.go`, and that is an observation about existing code, not a chosen policy. This document should be updated once a decision is recorded.
